  "abstract": "Confirm the accepted MoT head on higher-capacity ScalarRamp (H=160). Same shared horizon basis (R=4) and per-neuron soft assignments with \u03b1=0.07; MAE+curv unchanged. Tests whether structured neuron heterogeneity scales beyond H=128.",
